---
// About section component with latest iPadOS 26 Apple UI Kit design
---

<section id="about" class="pt-12 pb-16 relative">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-8 lg:px-12">
    <div class="backdrop-blur-xl rounded-[1.6rem] p-8 md:p-12 border" style="background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-surface) 92%, transparent); border-color: var(--color-border); box-shadow: 0 18px 48px var(--color-shadow);">
      <!-- Header -->
      <div class="text-center mb-16">
        <h2 class="text-4xl lg:text-5xl xl:text-6xl font-bold text-[var(--color-text)] mb-10 tracking-tight">
          About Me
        </h2>
      </div>

      <!-- Content -->
      <div class="max-w-[44rem] mx-auto">
        <div class="space-y-10">
          <div class="space-y-6">
            <p class="text-lg text-[var(--color-text-muted)] leading-[1.85] font-normal">
              I am a Customer Support and Customer Experience executive with 15+ years of experience building and scaling high-performing support organizations across fast-growing direct-to-consumer, eCommerce, subscription, nutrition, supplements, SaaS, and technology businesses.
            </p>
            <p class="text-lg text-[var(--color-text-muted)] leading-[1.85] font-normal">
              Most recently, as Sr. Director of Customer Support at Ka'Chava, I scaled the support function from a 1-agent operation to 95+ agents at peak growth, led operations through 1.5M+ resolved customer tickets, and maintained 89%+ CSAT across a high-volume nutrition, meal replacement, and subscription commerce environment.
            </p>
            <p class="text-lg text-[var(--color-text-muted)] leading-[1.85] font-normal">
              My work sits at the intersection of customer operations, support strategy, AI-enabled self-service, Zendesk optimization, workforce planning, vendor leadership, KPI development, and Voice of Customer programs. I help companies turn support from a reactive function into a scalable operating system for customer trust, retention, and growth.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="pt-2">
            <a
              href="/YD_resume.pdf"
              download="YD_resume.pdf"
              class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-3 rounded-2xl px-7 py-3.5 text-base font-semibold text-[var(--color-executive)] transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:shadow-lg"
              style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--color-primary), var(--color-primary-dark)); box-shadow: 0 10px 28px color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-primary) 30%, transparent);"
            >
              <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 4v10m0 0l-4-4m4 4l4-4M4 20h16"></path>
              </svg>
              Download Resume
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
